# Boundary guard runtime failure: Unknown-typed value crosses Int boundary
# from-json returns Unknown type; the type checker records a boundary guard at
# the call-arg position. At runtime the value is a String, so the guard fires
# with a type assertion failure (E011). No type warning expected: Unknown is
# consistent with Int (AGT), so the type checker passes the call site.
[call [fn [x@Int] $x] [from-json "\"hello\""]]
=== error
[E011] type assertion failed: expected Int, got String
